Comment: 0,0:00:00.60,0:00:00.63,Default,chptr,0,0,0,,{Opening}
Comment: 0,0:01:26.41,0:01:26.44,Default,chptr,0,0,0,,{Episode}
Comment: 0,0:00:00.60,0:00:00.63,Default,OP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 50,0:01:34.99,0:01:35.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ohhhhhhh!
Dialogue: 50,0:01:38.55,0:01:39.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Watch where you're stepping!
Dialogue: 50,0:01:39.79,0:01:40.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You could've killed us!
Dialogue: 50,0:01:40.92,0:01:41.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oops!
Dialogue: 50,0:01:42.23,0:01:43.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sorry!
Dialogue: 50,0:01:47.34,0:01:48.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Look at you!
Dialogue: 50,0:01:48.65,0:01:51.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bonney's not the only one\Nwho's hit a growth spurt.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:51.57,0:01:54.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You won't lay a finger\Non Old Man Apple!
Dialogue: 50,0:01:54.83,0:01:57.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Listen kids, some\Nof us have jobs.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:57.94,0:02:01.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let me go back\Nto doing mine, please.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:02.35,0:02:03.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let you go.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:03.27,0:02:04.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:06.85,0:02:08.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ha ha ha ha ha ha!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:09.63,0:02:10.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ha!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:11.71,0:02:12.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ohhhhhhh!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:23.61,0:02:24.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Light it!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:36.89,0:02:39.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whoa, take it easy!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:40.39,0:02:41.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tch!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:44.93,0:02:45.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tch!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:58.11,0:02:59.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We have to run now!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:59.39,0:03:00.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's hurry!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:00.20,0:03:01.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're right!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:01.36,0:03:03.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's go while Luffy\Nkeeps Kizaru busy!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:03.91,0:03:11.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Okay, but we have to be\Ngentle with Robin. Hey, Atlas!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:12.25,0:03:14.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I have to take control\Nof the pacifistas!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:14.83,0:03:15.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Otherwise...
Dialogue: 50,0:03:15.79,0:03:17.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,as soon as the barrier\Nfalls down...
Dialogue: 50,0:03:21.97,0:03:24.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Their lasers will blow\Nus to smithereens!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:25.22,0:03:26.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's good thinking!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:26.60,0:03:30.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Us Vegapunks are the highest\Nauthority on the island after all!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:30.39,0:03:32.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And whoever controls\Nthe pacifistas wins!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:33.59,0:03:34.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hell yeah!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:34.72,0:03:35.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We've got this!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:37.04,0:03:38.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Atlas, wait!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:38.66,0:03:40.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That is I mean to say...
Dialogue: 50,0:03:40.42,0:03:41.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Please!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:41.63,0:03:42.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Take me with you!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:42.97,0:03:43.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:44.74,0:03:46.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You cannot go!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:46.30,0:03:47.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why not?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:47.23,0:03:48.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are you kidding me?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:48.43,0:03:51.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There are 30,000 marines out\Nthere who all want you dead!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:51.69,0:03:53.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I know, but...
Dialogue: 50,0:03:53.84,0:03:55.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Come in, Franky!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:55.16,0:03:56.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This is Vegapunk!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:56.13,0:03:56.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Can you hear me?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:56.98,0:03:57.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's up?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:57.73,0:03:59.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I just saw Bonney\Ndown in the city!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:59.96,0:04:01.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,She's alive then?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:01.15,0:04:02.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What a relief!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:02.28,0:04:03.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,She hit the barrier!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:03.53,0:04:05.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kizaru's the one who\Nkicked her hard!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:05.12,0:04:06.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He did what to her!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:06.79,0:04:08.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And you just stood\Nthere and watched!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:08.39,0:04:10.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're a grown man!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:10.40,0:04:11.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, okay?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:12.00,0:04:13.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll go save her right now!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:13.73,0:04:14.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You'd better!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:14.90,0:04:17.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But what are we gonna\Ndo about the barrier?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:19.06,0:04:20.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I've made up my mind!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:20.27,0:04:20.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm going!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:20.89,0:04:21.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:21.58,0:04:24.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They'll have Edison\Ndeactivate the barrier!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:27.61,0:04:29.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hey, it's Sanji!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:30.05,0:04:31.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I heard what you said.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:31.63,0:04:32.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All of it.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:35.80,0:04:38.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're gonna go\Nin and rescue her, right?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:38.08,0:04:39.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Then you can count me in!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:40.01,0:04:41.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Our work here is done.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:41.40,0:04:45.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We picked up the luggage you\Nasked us to and we're on our way.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:45.25,0:04:47.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'll head toward the rear\Nexit immediately.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:47.60,0:04:49.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Let's all meet up there.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:51.78,0:04:53.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Reporting in!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:53.11,0:04:56.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We've all been turned into\Nchildren or old people!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:56.98,0:04:57.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:58.26,0:05:00.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Everyone, avoid\Nthe center of town!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:00.15,0:05:01.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's a trap!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:01.29,0:05:04.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All central units were\Nambushed by Jewelry Bonney!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:04.77,0:05:06.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Search the surrounding\Nzones cautiously!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:06.96,0:05:08.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,She has the power\Nto change your age!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:08.58,0:05:14.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,She can't have gotten far!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:14.43,0:05:17.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Find Jewelry Bonney\Nand take her down!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:19.61,0:05:20.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:20.27,0:05:21.17,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Hey!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:21.26,0:05:22.27,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Over here!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:23.32,0:05:24.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I found Sentomaru!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:25.72,0:05:26.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But he...
Dialogue: 50,0:05:28.39,0:05:30.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It looks like he's been burned.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:30.89,0:05:31.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But he...
Dialogue: 50,0:05:31.20,0:05:31.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sentomaru...
Dialogue: 50,0:05:45.26,0:05:46.09,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Sentomaru?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:47.30,0:05:48.10,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Run away...
Dialogue: 50,0:05:48.83,0:05:49.63,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Bonney...
Dialogue: 50,0:05:51.24,0:05:52.42,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,The Marines...
Dialogue: 50,0:05:52.50,0:05:53.47,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Are coming...
Dialogue: 50,0:05:59.14,0:05:59.94,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Sentomaru!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:02.61,0:06:03.49,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,What should I do?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:03.57,0:06:04.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Have you found her?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:04.46,0:06:05.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Not yet, sir!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:05.37,0:06:06.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Check that way!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:06.22,0:06:06.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:08.81,0:06:09.58,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,We need to find her!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:09.58,0:06:12.06,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,I wonder if I can hide\Nuntil this is all over.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:14.89,0:06:16.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We need to find her!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:16.70,0:06:17.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:18.12,0:06:19.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Was that pigeon guy?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:19.98,0:06:21.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Zoro!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:21.10,0:06:22.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Do you want my help?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:25.12,0:06:27.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just focus on Kizaru!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:27.30,0:06:28.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's the real problem!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:29.76,0:06:30.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ha!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:30.24,0:06:31.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ha!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:45.21,0:06:47.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ha, you're barely keeping up.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:47.43,0:06:51.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If this is the best you can do, you're\Nnever gonna get another shot at our captain.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:52.00,0:06:55.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ha ha ha,\Nbut I've still got you.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:55.97,0:06:57.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,An Emperor's first mate.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:58.40,0:07:00.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's a worthy trophy.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:14.99,0:07:18.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,When I might drown,\Nthat won't do at all.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:26.18,0:07:30.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Yasakani Sacred Jewel!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:36.39,0:07:37.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ow!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:43.39,0:07:44.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:44.78,0:07:46.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:12.75,0:08:13.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ow!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:19.11,0:08:19.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,My face!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:26.03,0:08:37.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}I see! These are holograms!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:37.09,0:08:38.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't know which one's real!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:40.95,0:08:41.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gah!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:46.99,0:08:48.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just kidding!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:49.31,0:08:50.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll hit them all!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:51.45,0:08:52.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Gum-Gum...!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:52.99,0:08:53.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Dawn...!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:24.11,0:09:26.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now this is unfortunate.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:27.11,0:09:29.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I leave for one second\Nand Vegapunk is gone.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:30.26,0:09:32.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Could you tell me\Nwhere he is, please?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:32.86,0:09:36.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There ain't nothing I can do,\Nso I'll help right there.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:37.51,0:09:38.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:50.86,0:09:51.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:51.77,0:09:53.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Vegapunk!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:53.18,0:09:54.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let me in there!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:55.56,0:09:57.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're really worked up!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:57.22,0:09:58.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Not that I blame you, though.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:58.67,0:10:01.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't you touch her, you\Nbootlicking Navy scum!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:01.85,0:10:03.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Never fear, Bonney!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:03.11,0:10:03.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm on my way!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:04.02,0:10:05.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stay strong!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:05.26,0:10:08.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I should have protected you,\Nyou poor darling child!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:08.86,0:10:10.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Poor darling child?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:10.36,0:10:11.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Get in already!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:12.02,0:10:13.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll let you in the bubble!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:14.02,0:10:15.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just shove yourself through!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:15.96,0:10:17.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, if you say so.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:17.57,0:10:18.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:18.67,0:10:19.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gah!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:19.90,0:10:20.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:25.64,0:10:27.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:27.25,0:10:28.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stay in the dome thing!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:28.50,0:10:30.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're gonna get\Nkilled out here!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:33.94,0:10:36.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Did you think I'd\Njust let you run?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:38.59,0:10:40.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is over, old man.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:03.55,0:11:04.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Back already?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:04.45,0:11:05.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:06.19,0:11:07.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stella!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:08.09,0:11:09.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Change of plans!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:09.08,0:11:11.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We'll use General Franky\Nto carry the Sunny!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:11.75,0:11:14.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm catching a ride\Nwith these bros!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:14.33,0:11:15.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:16.51,0:11:17.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:21.16,0:11:25.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh...
Dialogue: 50,0:11:26.76,0:11:30.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh...
Dialogue: 50,0:11:43.74,0:11:44.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Do it!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:45.32,0:11:46.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Right away!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:46.74,0:11:47.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Frontier Dome!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:47.86,0:11:49.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Partially deactivate!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:52.00,0:11:53.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Reactivate!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:57.30,0:11:59.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Can this thing fly?!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:10.00,0:12:11.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait, what's that?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:12.75,0:12:13.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Something's up there.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:14.63,0:12:16.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hold on, I think\NI can see inside.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:17.34,0:12:18.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's Doctor Vegapunk!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:20.94,0:12:23.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I have a report from\Nthe Fabriophase!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:23.68,0:12:24.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's urgent!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:24.68,0:12:26.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We've just spotted Vegapunk!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:26.68,0:12:29.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's descending from\Nthe Labophase in a vehicle!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:29.14,0:12:29.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Take aim!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:30.04,0:12:30.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Prepare to fire!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:41.00,0:12:41.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pacifistas!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:42.40,0:12:44.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You have a new order!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:44.24,0:12:46.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Direct from Dr. Vegapunk!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:46.48,0:12:48.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Every marine on the island!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:23.63,0:13:25.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I think it's aiming at us!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:26.69,0:13:28.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,New target designated.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:29.37,0:13:31.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Eliminate all marines\Non Egghead.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:31.59,0:13:32.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:48.41,0:13:50.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They have a new order.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:50.16,0:13:52.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dr. Vegapunk must have\Ntaken control back.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:58.01,0:13:59.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So many pacifistas!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:59.58,0:14:01.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How are we supposed\Nto fight them all?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:03.08,0:14:04.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Damn you, Vegapunk!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:05.86,0:14:06.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:07.16,0:14:08.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now it's a party!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:10.11,0:14:11.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's rip, pacifistas!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:13.66,0:14:15.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Seems they're all responding\Nto the command.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:16.01,0:14:16.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:20.21,0:14:21.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hold up!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:21.30,0:14:23.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It looks like we're\Ngoing straight down!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:23.30,0:14:25.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're not going to dive bomb\Ninto the ground, are we?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:25.95,0:14:27.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We are on island clouds.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:27.59,0:14:30.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's in their nature\Nto attach to one another.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:30.26,0:14:34.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Since our tires are also made of clouds,\Nwe won't fall to our deaths even if we head
Dialogue: 50,0:14:34.75,0:14:35.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,straight down.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:36.03,0:14:37.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But enough about our ride.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:37.76,0:14:39.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We must find Bonney!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:39.80,0:14:41.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,She's surely alone\Nand terrified down there!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:41.96,0:14:42.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey Bonney!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:44.95,0:14:45.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bonney!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:45.87,0:14:47.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey Bonney!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:48.79,0:14:49.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bonney!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:58.29,0:15:00.08,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,I need to focus.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:00.16,0:15:01.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't think.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:01.42,0:15:02.22,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Feel.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:02.67,0:15:08.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll reach out across the entire universe\Nand sense her with the waves of my soul.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:19.09,0:15:20.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,My lady-dar got a ping!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:20.84,0:15:21.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I found her!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:22.71,0:15:23.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Where is she?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:23.45,0:15:26.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All I can see are marines\Neverywhere I look!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:26.41,0:15:27.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Same for me!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:27.05,0:15:28.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are you sure?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:28.22,0:15:29.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't question me!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:29.27,0:15:31.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,My lady-dar has never\Nbeen wrong once!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:31.47,0:15:32.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:33.50,0:15:37.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I dispute the science of your methods,\Nbut I will trust your instinct!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:37.85,0:15:38.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Doctor!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:39.67,0:15:44.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now if you'll all excuse me, this tank just\Ncan't keep up with my impatient heart!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:46.98,0:15:48.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, Bonney!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:48.66,0:15:49.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm on my way!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:52.83,0:15:53.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What a relief.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:54.47,0:15:57.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Looks like the pacifistas\Nare back on our side.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:08.27,0:16:09.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thought you could hide, huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:10.45,0:16:13.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is over, Jewelry Bonney!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:13.32,0:16:15.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You'll pay for what\Nyou did to our men!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:16.76,0:16:17.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Over there!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:17.47,0:16:18.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:25.94,0:16:27.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Over there!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:27.82,0:16:28.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Go!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:40.95,0:16:41.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ahhhhh!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:56.73,0:16:58.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What the hell is wrong\Nwith you three?!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:58.57,0:16:59.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I just think I have\Na heart attack.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:59.39,0:16:59.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I think I just...
Dialogue: 50,0:16:59.91,0:17:00.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:02.51,0:17:04.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Get back here!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:04.11,0:17:05.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm not done with you!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:09.35,0:17:10.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You cannot escape!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:11.75,0:17:12.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:13.63,0:17:14.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:15.41,0:17:16.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:17.03,0:17:17.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ha!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:18.27,0:17:23.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't command all the pacifistas,\Nbut I snuck around the rules for this one!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:24.13,0:17:28.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I have the power to control anything I sit\Non, cause I'm a driving human who eats the
Dialogue: 50,0:17:28.84,0:17:29.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ride-Ride fruit!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:30.06,0:17:31.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now here's a little question.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:31.81,0:17:35.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Will the curse you placed\Non our men be lifted if I kill you?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:41.37,0:17:41.99,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Dad...
Dialogue: 50,0:17:41.99,0:17:44.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Last chance, kiddo!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:45.27,0:17:47.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Change them back now!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:50.15,0:17:50.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:56.24,0:17:57.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Come on, Bonney.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:57.34,0:17:58.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't zone out on us now.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:01.08,0:18:01.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Blackleg?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:02.90,0:18:04.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Look, I get it.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:04.23,0:18:06.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's because Kuma's\Nyour father, right?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:10.06,0:18:12.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You have to remember\Nthey're not him.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:12.37,0:18:13.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you can't...
Dialogue: 50,0:18:15.16,0:18:16.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Otter Hammer!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:21.17,0:18:22.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Marines everywhere.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:25.24,0:18:26.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Time for us to go.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:26.60,0:18:28.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Go pacifista!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:28.58,0:18:29.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:31.88,0:18:32.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A spear!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:33.56,0:18:34.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:40.54,0:18:41.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Slippers?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:43.94,0:18:45.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll let you know!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:50.18,0:18:51.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:51.30,0:18:51.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:51.78,0:18:52.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Look!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:52.48,0:18:52.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Here's the machine!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:52.58,0:18:54.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait, you have to get it!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:52.77,0:18:54.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll do it!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:08.64,0:19:09.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:10.86,0:19:11.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:27.43,0:19:31.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Look, I don't know why you're doing\Nthis, but I've got orders to follow.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:34.25,0:19:35.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't care!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:44.42,0:19:50.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you'll excuse me, I have a mission to wrap\Nup and you are wasting too much of my time!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:56.14,0:19:57.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's the idea!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:59.46,0:20:02.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's my mission\Nto get in your way!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:05.72,0:20:07.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What to do...
Dialogue: 50,0:20:11.16,0:20:12.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Come back!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:26.12,0:20:27.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why did you stop?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:27.20,0:20:27.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:28.39,0:20:29.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's weird.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:30.04,0:20:31.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Something doesn't feel right.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:31.92,0:20:33.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:33.27,0:20:35.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Such an unnatural presence.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:52.77,0:20:54.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't believe\Nwhat I'm seeing.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:55.64,0:20:59.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All units, stand down.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:06.52,0:21:06.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Look!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:06.84,0:21:10.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The pacifistas aren't\Nprotecting us anymore!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:10.72,0:21:12.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're not even moving!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:12.36,0:21:12.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:12.76,0:21:13.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I gave you an order!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:15.94,0:21:17.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're supposed\Nto keep us safe!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:19.88,0:21:21.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Something's happening!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:23.01,0:21:26.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's only one group above\NVegapunk on the authority ladder.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:26.87,0:21:27.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And that's...
Dialogue: 50,0:21:29.52,0:21:30.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The Five Elders!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:46.82,0:21:48.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's a pentagram!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:58.65,0:22:00.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 50,0:22:00.82,0:22:01.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Step on it!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:01.80,0:22:02.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Get to high ground!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:03.04,0:22:04.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll try!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:07.77,0:22:09.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Attention all marines!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:09.74,0:22:11.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Saint Saturn is on his way!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:12.36,0:22:14.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He will arrive\Non Egghead shortly!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:15.33,0:22:20.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Not a single marine below the rank\Nof Commodore may be in his presence!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:21.01,0:22:22.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's coming here?
Dialogue: 50,0:22:22.13,0:22:22.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I repeat!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:22.98,0:22:27.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Saint Saturn of the Five Elders\Nwill make landfall on Egghead!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:36.11,0:22:38.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What was that explosion?
Dialogue: 50,0:22:38.88,0:22:40.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,One of the Five Elders.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:40.55,0:22:42.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So I'm shocked that\Nthey came in person.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:42.69,0:22:43.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The Five Elders?
Dialogue: 50,0:22:44.01,0:22:44.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Never heard of them.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:44.98,0:22:45.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who are they?
Dialogue: 50,0:22:45.97,0:22:48.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The highest authorities\Nin the world!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:48.32,0:22:49.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait, for real?
Dialogue: 50,0:23:10.05,0:23:13.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Something big's coming out!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:39.55,0:23:40.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What the hell is that?
Dialogue: 50,0:23:41.29,0:23:42.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's some kind of monster!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:42.68,0:23:43.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Cut it out!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:43.95,0:23:45.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That must be...
Dialogue: 50,0:23:45.31,0:23:46.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Go away!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:54.91,0:23:56.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The surface.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:57.30,0:23:59.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's been quite a while.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:02.34,0:24:04.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's huge!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:05.55,0:24:06.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What is that thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.56,0:24:07.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Above us!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:09.12,0:24:09.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dodge!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:14.36,0:24:15.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oops.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:16.65,0:24:18.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That was a close one.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:18.70,0:24:20.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We don't have any\Nclouds to grasp!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:23.84,0:24:24.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kizaru!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:32.49,0:24:35.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Boy, you gotta be\Nrunning out of juice.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:35.33,0:24:37.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That form won't hold up.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:37.13,0:24:38.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Do something, Luffy!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:38.84,0:24:40.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're literally gonna die!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:49.12,0:24:50.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I got you!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:57.07,0:24:58.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Oh god!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:04.04,0:25:04.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Stop!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:07.47,0:25:10.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ahem.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:19.37,0:25:20.17,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Nope.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:21.50,0:25:22.98,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.55,0:25:56.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You okay, Doc?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.92,0:25:58.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Still breathing?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.17,0:25:59.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So it would seem.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.93,0:26:00.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Atlas, are you hurt?
Dialogue: 50,0:26:01.37,0:26:01.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.85,0:26:02.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are you Saint Saturn?
Dialogue: 50,0:26:11.47,0:26:12.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I am.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:15.26,0:26:18.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I thought you were\Nalready dead, Vegapunk.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:19.68,0:26:20.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What a shame.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:27.49,0:26:30.56,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,I gave you an order,\NVegapunk.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:40.27,0:26:40.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bonney, wait!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:40.86,0:26:41.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Please!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:46.99,0:26:50.08,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,You must eliminate\NKuma's free will.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:51.57,0:26:53.19,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,But if I do that to him...
Dialogue: 50,0:26:54.58,0:26:55.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll kill you!
